<title>
Precautions for Rearview Camera
</title>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
If the lens of the rearview camera is wiped with chemicals such as alcohol, benzine, thinner, etc., the lens may discolor.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
To clean the lens of the rearview camera, refer to “Vehicle Cleaning” section of the Owner’s Manual.
</ptxt>
